{"id":"P088-2","subject":"P","unit":"P088","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P088-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n직류 발전기 정류자의 정류속도가 기존의 배가 되면,                                              \n\n직류 발전기의 회전속도는 어떻게 되는가?\n\n(단, 기타 조건은 고려하지 않는다.)\n\n① 배         ② 배                               \n\n③ 배          ④ 배\n\n⑤ 무관","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":657}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n다음과 같은 3상 동기발전기의 무부하 포화곡선에서 포화\n\n율이 0.8일 때, 의 값은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 6.4          ② 8.6\n\n③ 10.2         ④ 12.8\n\n⑤ 14.4","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":798},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1225}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":