하 운전시 동손이 1600W이고, 부                                                          \n하 운전시 전손실이 200W일 때, 변압기의 철손은 몇\n\nW인가?\n\n\n① 100         ② 200\n\n③ 400         ④ 800\n\n⑤ 1400","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":674},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":557}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n단상 변압기의 1차 환산 임피던스가 Ω, 임피던스\n\n전압이 V, 정격용량 kVA 일 때, 1차 정격전압은\n몇 kV인가?\n\n\n① 5           ② 10\n\n③ 15          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 25","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":927}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n1차측 정격전압이 3kV, 1차 환산 리액턴스가 7Ω인\n36kVA 의 단상 변압기의 퍼센트 리액턴스는 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 1.5          ② 1.8\n\n③ 2.1          ④ 2.5\n\n⑤ 2.8","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":566},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":955}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n변압기에 사용하는 절연유의 구비조건으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 점도가 낮아야 한다.\n\n② 인화점이 낮아야 한다.\n\n③ 응고점이 높아야 한다.\n\n④ 절연내력이 낮아야 한다.\n\n⑤ 냉각효과가 작아야 한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1008}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n\n\n다음 중 변압기 온도상승시험에 해당하는 것은?\n\n    ㉠ 실부하법     ㉡ 충격전압시험법\n\n    ㉢ 반환부하법    ㉣ 유도시험법\n\n    ㉤ 단락시험법    ㉥ 가압시험법\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉠㉢㉣\n\n③ ㉠㉢㉤        ④ ㉡㉣㉥\n\n⑤ ㉡㉤㉥","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src"