18,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n다음과 같은 승압형 초퍼(Boost converter)회로에서,\n듀티비가 0.8이고, 출력전압이 V일 때,\n입력전압 는 몇 V인가?\n\n(단, 과 는 충분히 크다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n① 100         ② 200\n\n③ 400         ④ 550\n\n⑤ 800","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m43-q.webp","width":678,"height":831},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m43-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1403}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\nOF(Oil Filled) 고압 케이블의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 온도 변화에 따른 공극이 생긴다.\n\n② 온도변화에 따른 팽창, 수축을 유조에서 흡수한다.\n\n③ 사용온도가 높아서 송전용량이 크다.\n\n④ 별도의 급유 설비가 필요하다.\n\n⑤ 접속이 까다롭다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m44-q.webp","width":678,"height":489},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m44-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1347}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n어느 수용가에서 상시 사용하는 조명 및 전열 부하의 설비\n\n용량 합계가 50kVA이고, 동력설비는 부하 집계표와 같\n\n을 때, 이 수용가의 합성최대수요전력은 몇 kVA인가?\n\n(단, 조명 및 전열 부하의 역률은 1이고, 동력설비의 역률\n\n은 0.8이며, 각 설비의 수용률과 부등률은 모두 1이다.)\n\n    설비   설비용량 개수  상용  하계  동계\n\n    송풍기   2[kW]    2   4[kW]\n  일\n\n  반\n    급수펌프  3[kW]    4   12[kW]\n\n    스탠드\n               4[kW]    1          4[kW]\n  냉  에어컨\n  방  벽걸이\n               2[kW]    1          2[kW]\n    에어컨\n\n    전기난로  5[kW]    5                25[kW]\n  난\n\n  방\n    온풍기   5[kW]    2                10[kW]\n\n\n\n① 101.25        ② 108.25\n\n③ 113.75        ④ 118.75\n\n⑤ 121.25","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m45-q.webp","width":696,"height":1294},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m45-e1.webp","width":678,"height":535},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m45-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n다음 중 지락사고 발생시에 영상전압을 검출하는 기기는?\n\n\n① UVR         ② OVR\n\n③ OVGR        ④ ZCT\n\n⑤ NGR","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m46-q.webp","width":696,"height":588},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m46-e1.webp","width":678,"height":468}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 47번","searchText":" 47\n\n다음 그림과 같은 계통접지의 종류는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① TT계통        ② TN-S계통\n\n③ TN-C계통       ④ TN-C-S계통\n\n⑤ IT계통","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m47","number":47},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m47-q.webp","width":678,"height":1101},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m47-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1414},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m47-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S2-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 48번","searchText":" 48\n\n수변전 설비의 인입구 개폐기로 많이 사용되고 있으며 전력\n\n퓨즈의 용단시 결상을 방지하기 위한 목적으로 사용되는\n\n개폐기는?\n\n\n① DS          ② ASS\n\n③ LA          ④ CB\n\n⑤ LBS","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m48","number":48},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m48-q.webp","width":678,"height":781},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m48-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,